%N A398285 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^k * (H(k)^4 - H(k,2)^2)/k, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number, and H(k,2) = A007406(k)/A007407(k) is the k-th generalized harmonic number of order 2.
%H A398285 Cornel Ioan Vălean, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-02462-8">(Almost) Impossible Integrals, Sums, and Series</a>, Springer International Publishing, 2019, section 4.58, p. 313, section 5.58, p. 328, section 6.58, pp. 523-530.
